WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.945
Are you an insurance advisor or intermediary?

2
00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.419
An advisor account gives you the Advisor Hub

3
00:00:05.419 --> 00:00:09.145
on avrastro.com and AVRASTRO CRM.

4
00:00:10.245 --> 00:00:12.637
In the Hub you find appointment requests for times

5
00:00:12.637 --> 00:00:15.538
that are genuinely free, which you confirm,

6
00:00:15.597 --> 00:00:19.265
decline or cancel, and the citizen is told by e-mail.

7
00:00:19.637 --> 00:00:22.957
You also find messages, call-back requests and whatever

8
00:00:22.957 --> 00:00:26.695
a citizen has shared with you, until the date they set.

9
00:00:27.795 --> 00:00:30.245
You appear publicly in the advisor directory

10
00:00:30.245 --> 00:00:32.345
once your registration number is verified.

11
00:00:32.590 --> 00:00:35.642
From the Hub you set your availability and public profile,

12
00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:38.115
and build a client report to print.

13
00:00:39.215 --> 00:00:43.150
From the CRM card in the Hub you open AVRASTRO CRM:

14
00:00:43.244 --> 00:00:46.923
the Today screen, the client view and applications by stage.

15
00:00:47.226 --> 00:00:49.384
If you keep contacts in a spreadsheet,

16
00:00:49.513 --> 00:00:52.136
you import them as a list with a preview.

17
00:00:53.236 --> 00:00:55.302
Whatever a citizen shares with you,

18
00:00:55.326 --> 00:00:59.748
you see only with their consent, and only while the share lasts.

19
00:01:00.848 --> 00:01:03.750
Create an advisor account on avrastro.com.

20
00:01:03.994 --> 00:01:06.803
The trial lasts fourteen days and needs no card.
